questions.starter:
import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    // Remove every word shorter than minLength from the list.
    static void removeShort(List<String> words, int minLength) {
        for (String w : words) {
            if (w.length() < minLength) {
                words.remove(w);
            }
        }
    }
}

solution.en:
A for-each loop over a list uses the list's iterator behind the scenes. The iterator remembers how many structural changes (adds and removes) the list had when it was created. words.remove(w) changes the list without telling the iterator. On the next call to next(), the iterator sees that the list has changed and throws ConcurrentModificationException.

This is a safety check. If the loop carried on, the elements would shift left under the iterator, so some words would be skipped, and the loop would give wrong answers silently. Java prefers to fail loudly. (There is a quirk: if the removed element is the second to last, hasNext() answers false and the loop ends without an error. Do not rely on it.)

Fix with an explicit Iterator and its own remove method, which tells the iterator about the change:

Iterator<String> it = words.iterator();
while (it.hasNext()) {
    if (it.next().length() < minLength) {
        it.remove();
    }
}

Other correct fixes: loop over the indexes from the end down to 0 and call remove(i), or collect the words to keep in a new list. Calling remove(w) on the list also removes only the first equal word, which is another reason to avoid it here.

solution.zh:
对列表做的 for-each 循环，在幕后使用的是列表的迭代器。迭代器在创建时会记住列表已发生的结构性修改（添加和删除）的次数。words.remove(w) 修改了列表，却没有通知迭代器。下一次调用 next() 时，迭代器发现列表已经变了，就抛出 ConcurrentModificationException。

这是一种安全检查。如果循环继续下去，元素会在迭代器脚下左移，一些单词会被跳过，循环会悄悄地给出错误结果。Java 宁愿大声地失败。（有一个特例：如果被删除的是倒数第二个元素，hasNext() 会返回 false，循环不报错就结束了。不要依赖它。）

用显式的 Iterator 和它自己的 remove 方法来修正，这个方法会通知迭代器这次修改：

Iterator<String> it = words.iterator();
while (it.hasNext()) {
    if (it.next().length() < minLength) {
        it.remove();
    }
}

其他正确的修法：从后向前按下标循环到 0 并调用 remove(i)，或者把要保留的单词收集到一个新列表中。对列表调用 remove(w) 还只会删除第一个相等的单词，这是在这里避免它的另一个理由。

