questions.starter:
class Renderer {
    String render(Object item) {
        return "[" + item + "]";
    }
}

class BoldRenderer extends Renderer {
    String render(String item) {
        return "<b>" + item + "</b>";
    }
}

public class Main {
    static String renderAll(Renderer r, String a, String b) {
        return r.render(a) + r.render(b);
    }
}

solution.en:
BoldRenderer.render(String) does not override Renderer.render(Object). An override needs the same name and the same parameter types. String is not the same as Object, so this is a new, overloaded method. BoldRenderer now has two methods, render(Object) inherited and render(String) new.

In renderAll, the variable r has the declared type Renderer, and Renderer has only render(Object). The compiler therefore chooses render(Object) when it compiles the call. At run time, Java looks for the version of render(Object) in the real class BoldRenderer. There is none, so the inherited Renderer version runs, and the output is [x][y]. The extra overload is never even considered, because overloads are chosen at compile time from the declared types.

Fix: give the method the same signature as the one it should replace.

@Override
String render(Object item) {
    return "<b>" + item + "</b>";
}

The annotation @Override is the safety net. It tells the compiler "this method must override something". With the original render(String), the compiler would have refused with the error "method does not override or implement a method from a supertype". Always write @Override.

solution.zh:
BoldRenderer.render(String) 并没有重写 Renderer.render(Object)。重写要求方法名相同、参数类型也相同。String 与 Object 不是同一个类型，所以这是一个新的重载方法。BoldRenderer 现在有两个方法：继承来的 render(Object) 和新增的 render(String)。

在 renderAll 里，变量 r 的声明类型是 Renderer，而 Renderer 只有 render(Object)。所以编译器编译这个调用时选中的是 render(Object)。运行时，Java 在真实类 BoldRenderer 里寻找 render(Object) 的版本，找不到，于是运行继承来的 Renderer 版本，输出就是 [x][y]。新增的重载根本没有被考虑，因为重载是在编译时根据声明类型选定的。

修正：让方法的签名与它要替换的方法相同。

@Override
String render(Object item) {
    return "<b>" + item + "</b>";
}

注解 @Override 是安全网。它告诉编译器“这个方法必须重写某个方法”。对原来的 render(String)，编译器会报错：“method does not override or implement a method from a supertype”。请总是写上 @Override。

