}

questions.code:
List<String> words = new ArrayList<String>(Arrays.asList("pear", "fig", "apple", "kiwi", "date"));

Collections.sort(words, new Comparator<String>() {
    @Override
    public int compare(String a, String b) {
        if (a.length() != b.length()) {
            return a.length() - b.length();
        }
        return a.compareTo(b);
    }
});

solution.en:
(a) A lambda keeps only the parameter list and the body:

Collections.sort(words, (a, b) -> {
    if (a.length() != b.length()) {
        return a.length() - b.length();
    }
    return a.compareTo(b);
});

The parameter types are inferred from Comparator<String>. The body is a block, so it needs braces and a return statement. The result of sorting [pear, fig, apple, kiwi, date] is [fig, date, kiwi, pear, apple].

(b) Comparator is a functional interface: it has exactly one abstract method, compare. (It also declares equals, but that is a method of Object, so it does not count.) The target type tells the compiler which method the lambda implements, so the lambda does not need to name the interface or the method.

(c) Differences (one is enough):
- Inside an anonymous class, this means the anonymous object. Inside a lambda, this means the enclosing object, because a lambda is not a new object scope.
- An anonymous class is a class: it can declare fields, several methods and a constructor-like initialiser, and it can extend an abstract class. A lambda can only implement the single abstract method of a functional interface.
In common: both can read local variables of the surrounding method only if those variables are final or effectively final (never reassigned).

solution.zh:
(a) lambda 只保留参数列表和方法体：

Collections.sort(words, (a, b) -> {
    if (a.length() != b.length()) {
        return a.length() - b.length();
    }
    return a.compareTo(b);
});

参数类型由 Comparator<String> 推断出来。方法体是一个代码块，所以需要花括号和 return 语句。对 [pear, fig, apple, kiwi, date] 排序的结果是 [fig, date, kiwi, pear, apple]。

(b) Comparator 是函数式接口：它恰好有一个抽象方法 compare。（它还声明了 equals，但那是 Object 的方法，所以不计入。）目标类型告诉编译器 lambda 实现的是哪个方法，所以 lambda 不需要写出接口名和方法名。

(c) 区别（写出一个即可）：
- 在匿名类里，this 指匿名对象本身。在 lambda 里，this 指外围对象，因为 lambda 不会形成新的对象作用域。
- 匿名类是一个类：它可以声明字段、多个方法和初始化块，也可以继承抽象类。lambda 只能实现函数式接口的那一个抽象方法。
共同点：两者都只能读取外围方法中 final 或事实上的 final（从不重新赋值）的局部变量。

